{title: Far Beyond All That We Ask}
{subtitle: Ephesians 3:20}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 73}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] |
| [D#m] |
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [Bmaj7] | [Bmaj7] | ×2

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D#m]Christ dwells in hearts through faith
[Bmaj7]Rooted and grounded in love
[D#m]Power with saints to grasp
[Bmaj7]The wide and long and high and deep
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[D#m]To Him who is able to do
Far beyond [Bmaj7]all that we ask or imagine
Ac[D#m]cording to the power at work
Within [Bmaj7]us, glory [D#m]be
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Know the love that surpasses knowledge
[Bmaj7]Filled with the fullness of God
[D#m]In the church and in Christ Jesus
[Bmaj7]Glory throughout all generations
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [D#m] | [D#m] |
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [Bmaj7] | [Bmaj7] | ×2

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
For[D#m]ever and ever, Amen
Glory in the [Bmaj7]church and in Christ
Beyond our ask[D#m]ing, beyond our sight
The pow[Bmaj7]er at work within [D#m]us
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
To Him who is able to do
Far beyond all that [Bmaj7]we ask or imagine
According [D#m]to the power at work
Within us, glory [Bmaj7]be
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Outro}
